  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Fred Hollows Foundation support to the St John Eye Hospital in the Occupied Palestinian Territories</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This investment supports Australia&#x2019;s partnership with the Fred Hollows Foundation at the St John Eye Hospital. Activities include the provision of specialist equipment for the new medical facility and clinical support to clear the backlog of eye surgeries in the Occupied Palestinian Territories.</narrative>
  </description>
